------------------------------------------------
|            TexMol 2.0 - Usage                |
------------------------------------------------
Alex R. -- arand@ices.utexas.edu -- 10/20/2010

TexMol is a molecular visualization and computation 
package. It allows for quick and high quality 
visualization of Proteins and RNA.

Refer to the INSTALL file for build instructions.

More information is available via the Computational
Visualization Center's website: 

http://cvcweb.ices.utexas.edu/cvc


