TexMol is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1
(see LICENSE), the same licence as libcvc. A few third-party and legacy
components carry GPL headers instead; THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists them and
says which are compiled into a default build.
